    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "① 回执不是自动队列探针",
      "pos": [0, 630],
      "size": [760, 350],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"},
      "widgets_values": ["## 只记录真实观察\n\n`outcome`、`prompt_id`和`cache_observation`必须来自你实际看到的ComfyUI历史或输出。节点不会猜缓存命中，也不会自动Queue或Cancel。`completed`表示已经生成但等待人工复核；同一attempt随后只能`accepted`或`rejected`。"]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "② 继续位置的确定规则",
      "pos": [820, 630],
      "size": [760, 350],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 6,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"},
      "widgets_values": ["## render / review / retry / complete\n\nPlanner按镜头顺序工作：存在`completed`时先要求review；否则优先未尝试的确定性variant；所有variant都失败、取消或拒绝后才返回retry并递增attempt。某镜头有一个`accepted`候选后才继续下一镜头。把返回的`run_position/variant_index`手动填入现有Shot Select。"]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "③ 不自动删候选，也不承诺缓存命中",
      "pos": [1640, 630],
      "size": [760, 350],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"},
      "widgets_values": ["## 默认仍不改文件\n\nLedger和Retention Plan都只生成内存合同及拟删除清单。新Quarantine节点默认`prepare_only`，只核对输出目录内的普通文件并计算SHA，不移动、不删除。只有Retention Plan完成全部accept、路径复核开关打开并输出`READY_FOR_EXTERNAL_EXECUTOR`后，才可能进入下一阶段。取消ComfyUI中的真实任务仍由用户或现有Long Video Background控制器执行。"]
    },
